{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Skill Master rule file",
  "description": "Every rules.json and *.rules.json of a bundle is validated against this schema by engine/rule_runner.py; a rule file's own $schema value never selects the schema. The op enum lists the 16 ops unit A1 implements plus the A3 primitives: script_denylist (engine/primitives/script_denylist.py; data names a file under the bundle's data/ folder; group is one closed scan mode, review_of names the rules whose run-output matchers it reviews) and parity_skill, parity_invocation, parity_agent_name, parity_wrapper, parity_permissions (engine/primitives/parity.py, driven by targets/<tool>.json; the reason is the fact {reason}). The A4 primitives: heading_present (engine/primitives/heading_present.py; words names a HEADING_WORDS entry of the data file), description_heuristics (engine/primitives/description_heuristics.py; one measure of the frontmatter description, word lists and regexes from the data file) and local_refs (engine/primitives/local_refs.py; one check of the SKILL.md file references, depth and toc_lines as operands). The host ops host_frontmatter, host_frontmatter_fields, host_field_length, host_main_file_size, host_metadata_version, host_evals_count, host_tools_declared, host_success_measurable and host_scenarios run callables eva.py installs (engine/rule_runner.py HOST_OPS); a rule on one with no installed callable fails the load. Two rules may share an id only when their applies_to kinds are disjoint. generated_up_to_date stays out until its primitive exists. An op outcome is pass, fail, review or n/a; review always gives a needs-review row. na_must false gives an n/a row that is not must. message and fix are a string or an object keyed by outcome; both render op facts as {key}. applies_to [\"repository\"] runs the rule once at bundle load over the bundle folder as rules/ and the engine's schemas/, targets/ and policy/; a fail is a bundle error. Normalize: strip, nfkc, lower (str.lower), string-or-empty (first only: a missing or non-string value becomes the empty string, as eva.py _str_field reads a field). Selectors: frontmatter:<pointer>, json:<relpath>#<pointer>, toml:<relpath>#<pointer>, yaml:<relpath>#<pointer>, markdown:<relpath>, text:<relpath>, glob:<pattern>, path:basename; {key} in a relpath takes a top-level frontmatter string. Custom schema keywords for the schema op: x-python-regex (true: the string compiles with Python re), x-unique-by (key: object items with that key have distinct values), x-count-where ({where, min, max}: number of items valid under where), x-le ([a, b]: a <= b when both are numbers), x-path-exists (unit: a relative path to a regular file inside the unit), x-yaml-string (true: the frontmatter scalar is not typed by YAML 1.1).",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["ruleset", "version", "rules"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "$schema": {"type": "string"},
    "ruleset": {"$ref": "#/$defs/name"},
    "version": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$"},
    "rules": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rule"}, "x-unique-by": "id"}
  },
  "$defs": {
    "name": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$", "maxLength": 64},
    "rule": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "applies_to", "category", "severity", "protects", "source", "check", "message", "fix"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {"$ref": "#/$defs/name"},
        "applies_to": {
          "oneOf": [
            {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"enum": ["skill", "agent"]}},
            {"const": ["repository"]}
          ]
        },
        "na_must": {"type": "boolean"},
        "category": {"enum": ["structure", "single-task", "io", "evaluation", "language", "parity", "goal", "tool-use", "context"]},
        "severity": {"enum": ["fail", "soft", "review"]},
        "protects": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"enum": ["claude", "codex", "opencode", "hermes"]}},
        "source": {
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["url", "section", "verified"],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "url": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^https://[^\\s]+$"},
                "section": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
                "verified": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["house"],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "house": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
                "verified": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}, {"type": "null"}]}
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "check": {"$ref": "#/$defs/node"},
        "message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"},
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "anyOf": [{"required": ["pass"]}, {"required": ["fail"]}, {"required": ["review"]}, {"required": ["na"]}],
              "properties": {"pass": {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"}, "fail": {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"},
                             "review": {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"}, "na": {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"}}
            }
          ]
        },
        "fix": {
          "anyOf": [
            {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"},
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "anyOf": [{"required": ["fail"]}, {"required": ["review"]}],
              "properties": {"fail": {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"}, "review": {"$ref": "#/$defs/text"}}
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "text": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
    "node": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op"],
      "properties": {
        "op": {"enum": ["schema", "equals", "subset", "set_equals", "contains_text", "regex", "not_regex", "file_exists", "file_absent", "count", "max_bytes", "max_lines", "all", "any", "not", "when", "script_denylist", "parity_skill", "parity_invocation", "parity_agent_name", "parity_wrapper", "parity_permissions", "heading_present", "description_heuristics", "local_refs", "host_frontmatter", "host_frontmatter_fields", "host_field_length", "host_main_file_size", "host_metadata_version", "host_evals_count", "host_tools_declared", "host_success_measurable", "host_scenarios"]}
      },
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "schema"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-schema"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["equals", "subset", "set_equals"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-pair"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "contains_text"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-contains-text"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["regex", "not_regex"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-regex"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["file_exists", "file_absent"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-file"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "count"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-count"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["max_bytes", "max_lines"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-max"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["all", "any"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-list"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "not"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-not"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "when"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-when"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "script_denylist"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-script-denylist"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["parity_skill", "parity_wrapper", "parity_permissions"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-parity-tool"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "parity_invocation"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-parity-invocation"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "parity_agent_name"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-parity-agent-name"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "heading_present"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-heading-present"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "description_heuristics"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-description-heuristics"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "local_refs"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-local-refs"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"enum": ["host_frontmatter", "host_tools_declared", "host_success_measurable"]}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-bare"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "host_frontmatter_fields"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-frontmatter-fields"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "host_field_length"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-field-length"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "host_main_file_size"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-main-file-size"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "host_metadata_version"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-metadata-version"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "host_evals_count"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-evals-count"}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"op": {"const": "host_scenarios"}}}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/op-host-scenarios"}}
      ]
    },
    "data-file": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^data/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*\\.json$"},
    "op-heading-present": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "data", "words"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "data": {"$ref": "#/$defs/data-file"}, "words": {"$ref": "#/$defs/name"}}
    },
    "op-description-heuristics": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "data", "measure"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "data": {"$ref": "#/$defs/data-file"},
                     "measure": {"enum": ["present", "length", "no_xml", "when", "pov", "single_purpose"]},
                     "min": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}, "max": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}, "chars": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}},
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"measure": {"const": "length"}}}, "then": {"required": ["min"]}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"measure": {"const": "no_xml"}}}, "then": {"required": ["chars"]}}
      ]
    },
    "op-local-refs": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "check"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "check": {"enum": ["relative", "exist", "one_level", "path_depth", "toc"]},
                     "depth": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}, "toc_lines": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"},
                     "toc_pattern": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "x-python-regex": true}},
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"check": {"const": "path_depth"}}}, "then": {"required": ["depth"]}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"check": {"const": "toc"}}}, "then": {"required": ["toc_lines", "toc_pattern"]}}
      ]
    },
    "op-host-bare": {"type": "object", "required": ["op"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"op": true}},
    "op-host-frontmatter-fields": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "fields", "host_fields"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "fields": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}},
                     "host_fields": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}}
    },
    "op-host-field-length": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "field", "min", "max"], "additionalProperties": false, "x-le": ["min", "max"],
      "properties": {"op": true, "field": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "min": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}, "max": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}}
    },
    "op-host-main-file-size": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "max_bytes", "lines_below"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "max_bytes": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}, "lines_below": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}}
    },
    "op-host-metadata-version": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "pattern"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "pattern": {"type": "string", "x-python-regex": true}}
    },
    "op-host-evals-count": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "min"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "min": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}}
    },
    "op-host-scenarios": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "measure"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "measure": {"enum": ["present", "valid", "expected", "tools_subset", "multi_turn"]},
                     "min": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}},
      "allOf": [{"if": {"properties": {"measure": {"const": "present"}}}, "then": {"required": ["min"]}}]
    },
    "selector": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^(frontmatter|json|toml|yaml|markdown|text|glob|path):"},
    "normalize": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"enum": ["strip", "nfkc", "lower", "string-or-empty"]}},
    "tool": {"enum": ["claude", "codex", "opencode", "hermes"]},
    "relpaths": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/relpath"}},
    "matchers": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}},
    "ignore": {
      "oneOf": [
        {"type": "object", "required": ["patterns"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"patterns": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}}},
        {"type": "object", "required": ["dirs"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"dirs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}}}
      ]
    },
    "group": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["mode", "label"],
      "properties": {"mode": {"enum": ["main", "files", "json", "tree", "tree-json", "repository"]}, "label": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}},
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "main"}}}, "then": {"required": ["file"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": true, "label": true, "file": {"enum": ["SKILL.md", "AGENT.md"]}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "files"}}}, "then": {"required": ["files"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": true, "label": true, "files": {"$ref": "#/$defs/relpaths"}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "json"}}}, "then": {"required": ["files", "matchers"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": true, "label": true, "files": {"$ref": "#/$defs/relpaths"}, "matchers": {"$ref": "#/$defs/matchers"}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "tree"}}}, "then": {"required": ["top", "ignore", "exclude", "frontmatter_md"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": true, "label": true, "top": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^([a-z0-9_-]+)?$"}, "ignore": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ignore"}, "exclude": {"$ref": "#/$defs/relpaths"}, "frontmatter_md": {"type": "boolean"}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "tree-json"}}}, "then": {"required": ["top", "ignore", "matchers"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": true, "label": true, "top": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_-]+$"}, "ignore": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ignore"}, "matchers": {"$ref": "#/$defs/matchers"}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"mode": {"const": "repository"}}}, "then": {"required": ["folders"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"mode": true, "label": true, "folders": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"enum": ["rules", "schemas", "targets", "policy"]}}}}}
      ]
    },
    "op-script-denylist": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "data"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "oneOf": [{"required": ["group"]}, {"required": ["review_of"]}],
      "properties": {
        "op": true,
        "data": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^data/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*\\.json$"},
        "group": {"$ref": "#/$defs/group"},
        "review_of": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/name"}}
      }
    },
    "op-parity-tool": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "tool"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "tool": {"$ref": "#/$defs/tool"}}
    },
    "op-parity-invocation": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "tools"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "tools": {"enum": [["claude", "codex", "opencode"], ["hermes"]]}}
    },
    "op-parity-agent-name": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["op", "pattern"], "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "pattern": {"type": "string", "x-python-regex": true}}
    },
    "relpath": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
    "count": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
    "operand": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["sel"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {"sel": {"$ref": "#/$defs/selector"}, "normalize": {"$ref": "#/$defs/normalize"}}
        },
        {"type": "object", "required": ["value"], "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"value": true}}
      ]
    },
    "op-schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "sel", "schema"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "op": true,
        "sel": {"$ref": "#/$defs/selector"},
        "normalize": {"$ref": "#/$defs/normalize"},
        "schema": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*\\.schema\\.json$"}
      }
    },
    "op-pair": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "left", "right"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "left": {"$ref": "#/$defs/operand"}, "right": {"$ref": "#/$defs/operand"}}
    },
    "op-contains-text": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "sel", "text"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "op": true,
        "sel": {"$ref": "#/$defs/selector"},
        "normalize": {"$ref": "#/$defs/normalize"},
        "text": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}
      }
    },
    "op-regex": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "sel", "pattern"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "op": true,
        "sel": {"$ref": "#/$defs/selector"},
        "normalize": {"$ref": "#/$defs/normalize"},
        "pattern": {"type": "string", "x-python-regex": true}
      }
    },
    "op-file": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "path"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "path": {"$ref": "#/$defs/relpath"}}
    },
    "op-count": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "sel"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "anyOf": [{"required": ["min"]}, {"required": ["max"]}],
      "x-le": ["min", "max"],
      "properties": {
        "op": true,
        "sel": {"$ref": "#/$defs/selector"},
        "normalize": {"$ref": "#/$defs/normalize"},
        "min": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"},
        "max": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}
      }
    },
    "op-max": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "path", "max"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "path": {"$ref": "#/$defs/relpath"}, "max": {"$ref": "#/$defs/count"}}
    },
    "op-list": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "of"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "of": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/node"}}}
    },
    "op-not": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "check"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "check": {"$ref": "#/$defs/node"}}
    },
    "op-when": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["op", "if", "then"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"op": true, "if": {"$ref": "#/$defs/node"}, "then": {"$ref": "#/$defs/node"}}
    }
  }
}
